  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "世界經濟論壇-「局」已變，「勢」未明",
    "sub_ename": "FORUM OF WORLD ECONOMIES: UNCERTAIN ROLES IN A NEWLY CHANGED MULTI-POLAR WORLD",
    "describe_ch": "針對世界經濟趨勢的特色制榮譽課程，內容包括授課、專題演講和小組專題報告等等，協助學生建立全球視野。本學期將運用多元觀點，解讀當前國際政治、經濟、商業、科技等新趨勢。",
    "describe_eh": "This is a distinctive honors course on global economic trends, featuring lectures, keynote speeches, group project presentations, and field trips, designed to help students develop a global perspective. This semester, the course will employ multiple viewpoints to interpret new trends in international politics, economics, business, technology and more.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
